# Rounded box (superquadric): exponent e near 0 is boxy, 1 is an ellipsoid.
sqc(t,pw)=sign(cos(t))*abs(cos(t))^pw
sqs(t,pw)=sign(sin(t))*abs(sin(t))^pw
# Puffy capsule profile: like cr, plus a bulge bu in the middle.
cpf(u,r0,r1,bu)=(r0+(r1-r0)*cf(u)+bu*sin(u)^2)*sqrt(sqrt(1-cos(u)^4))

